    "name": "Lodge of Complaints",
    "steam_appid": 3788780,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Lodge of Complaints is a mythical destination for pilgrimages. It is said that in this lodge, any and all complaints about the universe will be heard and no visitor leaves dissatisfied.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey to the lodge is long and arduous, but there are many worthwhile reasons to undergo such hardships: Do you yearn for peace on earth, a cure for cancer, reversing climate change, or will you demand socks that\u2019ll always feel brand new? The lodge will process all complaints, be they big or small.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788780/extras/9a3deef935de0841476060bd2b36fbc2.poster.avif?t=1749395631\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788780/extras/9a3deef935de0841476060bd2b36fbc2.webm?t=1749395631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788780/extras/9a3deef935de0841476060bd2b36fbc2.mp4?t=1749395631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Fight For Your Cause</strong> <br>Battle across multiple lanes to outwit and outscore your opponent using diverse cards and strategies. Conquer terrain, boost control, and unleash powerful effects. Choose your focus: high scores, low-cost cards, synergy combos, or disrupting enemies. Hover over cards to see effects and dominate the field!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788780/extras/3070ba293b5fe49ecffc65fe067841c4.poster.avif?t=1749395631\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788780/extras/3070ba293b5fe49ecffc65fe067841c4.webm?t=1749395631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788780/extras/3070ba293b5fe49ecffc65fe067841c4.mp4?t=1749395631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Experience</strong><br>Tailor the game to your liking! While battles follow a set ruleset, you can fully personalize the dialogue, art, and outcomes of encounters. Our mod support allows you to customize:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cause you fight for</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player &amp; enemy art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards &amp; starter decks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backgrounds</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788780/extras/ee6893e1a469abdffdecff7072c8d4d4.poster.avif?t=1749395631\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788780/extras/ee6893e1a469abdffdecff7072c8d4d4.webm?t=1749395631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788780/extras/ee6893e1a469abdffdecff7072c8d4d4.mp4?t=1749395631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Lodge of Complaints is a mythical destination for pilgrimages. It is said that in this lodge, any and all complaints about the universe will be heard and no visitor leaves dissatisfied.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey to the lodge is long and arduous, but there are many worthwhile reasons to undergo such hardships: Do you yearn for peace on earth, a cure for cancer, reversing climate change, or will you demand socks that\u2019ll always feel brand new? The lodge will process all complaints, be they big or small.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788780/extras/9a3deef935de0841476060bd2b36fbc2.poster.avif?t=1749395631\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788780/extras/9a3deef935de0841476060bd2b36fbc2.webm?t=1749395631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788780/extras/9a3deef935de0841476060bd2b36fbc2.mp4?t=1749395631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Fight For Your Cause</strong> <br>Battle across multiple lanes to outwit and outscore your opponent using diverse cards and strategies. Conquer terrain, boost control, and unleash powerful effects. Choose your focus: high scores, low-cost cards, synergy combos, or disrupting enemies. Hover over cards to see effects and dominate the field!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788780/extras/3070ba293b5fe49ecffc65fe067841c4.poster.avif?t=1749395631\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788780/extras/3070ba293b5fe49ecffc65fe067841c4.webm?t=1749395631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788780/extras/3070ba293b5fe49ecffc65fe067841c4.mp4?t=1749395631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Experience</strong><br>Tailor the game to your liking! While battles follow a set ruleset, you can fully personalize the dialogue, art, and outcomes of encounters. Our mod support allows you to customize:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cause you fight for</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player &amp; enemy art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards &amp; starter decks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backgrounds</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788780/extras/ee6893e1a469abdffdecff7072c8d4d4.poster.avif?t=1749395631\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788780/extras/ee6893e1a469abdffdecff7072c8d4d4.webm?t=1749395631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788780/extras/ee6893e1a469abdffdecff7072c8d4d4.mp4?t=1749395631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "The Lodge of Complaints is a mythical place where all grievances are heard, big or small. Do you seek peace, a cure for cancer, or even ask for brand new feeling socks? The journey is tough but worth it. Fight battles, upgrade your deck, and evolve through strange encounters. Champion your cause!",
